{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10218","headline":"送马将军奏事毕归滑州使幕 · 李嘉佑","name":"送马将军奏事毕归滑州使幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴门别後蹈沧州，帝里相逢俱白头。\n自叹马卿常带病，还嗟李广未封侯。\n棠梨宫里瞻龙衮，细柳营前着豹裘。\n想到滑台桑叶落，黄河东注荻花秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10218.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10218","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}